    {
      "flavor_text": "てのひらの　あなから　イシツブテを\nはっしゃ。ぜんしんの　プロテクターは\nかざんの　ふんかにも　たえられる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "손바닥의 구멍에서 꼬마돌을\n발사한다. 전신의 프로텍터는\n화산의 분화도 견뎌낸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses paumes projettent des Racaillou, et son corps\ncouvert de Protecteurs résiste même à une éruption\nvolcanique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es feuert Kleinstein aus seinen Handflächen.\nDurch seinen Schützer erträgt es sogar\nVulkanausbrüche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lanza Geodude por los agujeros de las manos.\nGracias a Protector resiste erupciones volcánicas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mette dei Geodude nelle cavità dei palmi e li lancia.\nUsa Copertura per resistere alle eruzioni vulcaniche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "From holes in its palms, it fires out Geodude.\nIts carapace can withstand volcanic eruptions.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "手のひらの　穴から　イシツブテを\n発射。全身の　プロテクターは\n火山の　噴火にも　耐えられる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lanza Geodude por los agujeros de las manos.\nGracias a Protector resiste erupciones volcánicas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いわを　てのひらの　あなに　つめて\nきんにくの　ちからで　はっしゃする。\nまれに　イシツブテを　とばす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "바위를 손바닥의 구멍에 채워서\n근육의 힘으로 발사한다.\n드물게 꼬마돌을 날린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il bande ses muscles pour projeter des pierres ou\ndes Racaillou depuis le creux de ses paumes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es legt Steine in die Löcher seiner Hände und wirft sie\nmit Muskelkraft. Sogar Georok werden verwendet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pone rocas en los agujeros de sus manos y las lanza\ncon los músculos. A veces lanza Geodude.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
